<title>USA: Noranda Inc mine blast kills one - RCMP.</title>
<headline>Noranda Inc mine blast kills one - RCMP.</headline>
<dateline>NEWCASTLE, N.B. 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>One miner was killed and at least one more was injured in what may have been an underground explosion, Royal Canadian Mounted Police said.</p>
<p>&quot;The explosion took the life of one miner and injured another,&quot; RCMP spokesman Gaston Leblanc told Reuters in a phone interview from Fredricton, New Brunswick.</p>
